WEBVTT

00:31:28.038 --> 00:31:31.079
I think that that the norm will always
seem to be better to be together.

00:31:31.413 --> 00:31:36.663
But there's something great about
the focus and the, you know,

00:31:36.788 --> 00:31:39.454
the access that you have from anywhere.

00:31:39.663 --> 00:31:41.913
So I just think that that that's
something that, you know,

00:31:41.913 --> 00:31:48.121
clearly there will be infinitely fewer
business trips to have meetings that

00:31:48.121 --> 00:31:52.413
could now clearly be done on Zoome.
Will people go back to it?

00:31:52.413 --> 00:31:55.954
You know, the way we were before? More
than not, I believe they will, but.

00:31:57.788 --> 00:32:01.663
This is now accelerated the evidence
